          "author": "",
          "description": "These interactive short stories, trivia, and a catchy song are perfect for kids who love trucks and construction. From ice cream trucks to excavators, each story turns everyday challenges into exciting adventures. Along the journey, kids explore themes of resilience, patience, and empathy. Tender Tales are inclusive stories that celebrate all children and families 🏳️‍🌈. If your child enjoys these stories, learn more about Tender Tales in Yoto Space.",
